{
  "question": "What does Proforma need before it can price ethanol from glucose on this evidence, and what does the corn stover benchmark give?",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "text": "Proforma's stored corn stover ethanol benchmark, computed by the biorefineries.cornstover model, gives a minimum ethanol selling price that is a cellulosic breakeven price, not a price for batch fermentation of glucose.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "direct",
      "provenance": "computed",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [
        "35e708d122a6b4fc"
      ],
      "moduleRefs": [
        "proforma/artifact/35e708d122a6b4fc"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "text": "The benchmark's price is reported in both per-gallon and per-kilogram units, and the stored artifact names the package and BioSTEAM version it was computed with.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "direct",
      "provenance": "computed",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [
        "35e708d122a6b4fc"
      ],
      "moduleRefs": [
        "proforma/artifact/35e708d122a6b4fc"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gaps": [
    "Proforma holds no scenario for ethanol from glucose. The only scenarios are sc-pha-1 (a PHA draft, never run) and proforma_benchmark (corn stover ethanol). A glucose-to-ethanol scenario would need to be built and bound by a person.",
    "Inputs an ethanol-from-glucose scenario would need, none of which the corpus or Proforma supplies: a price of glucose or fermentable sugar, the sugar fed, and an ethanol titre and yield on glucose from a measured run. A search of the records for these was not made in this answer.",
    "The benchmark's rate-of-return, income-tax, operating-day and plant-year settings are stored with the artifact but were not returned in the tool output, so they cannot be stated here.",
    "The benchmark's breakeven price is for a corn stover plant with its own feed, pretreatment and enzymatic hydrolysis steps; it does not transfer to a glucose feed without a new scenario.",
    "A person would need to run sc-pha-1 in Proforma after binding the missing inputs before any selling price for it exists."
  ],
